{"id":"6f6018afad","t":"Crimson Reset","c":"cv","n":69,"l":69,"s":["ml","az","mg"],"k":{"ml":"crimson-reset","az":"crimson-reset","mg":"crimson-reset"},"u":1795078268378,"desc":"العودة القرمزية من إنتاج Redice Studio، استوديو Solo Leveling و Revenge of the Iron-Blooded Sword Hound، ونفس مؤلف Duke Pendragon. بعد نصف عام من الهرب، ينتهي المطاف بمصاص الدماء يوجين قتيلًا، يُقدَّم كقربان لرفع شأن أحد الفرسان المقدسين. وفي لحظاته الأخيرة، لا يجد سوى الندم المرير. لكن فرصة العودة تُمنَح له في اللحظة التي تنطفئ فيها حياته. “لن أموت بتلك الصورة مرة أخرى. إن كنتُ حقًا قد عدتُ إلى الماضي، فلن أسمح للندم بأن يعتريني ثانيةً… مهما كلف الأمر.","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","غموض","فانتازا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"crimson-reset","az":"crimson-reset","mg":"crimson-reset"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/1/","az":"crimson-reset|/series/crimson-reset/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/2/"},"3":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/3/"},"4":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/4/"},"5":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/5/"},"6":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/6/"},"7":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/7/"},"8":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/8/"},"9":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/9/"},"10":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/10/"},"11":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/11/"},"12":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/12/"},"13":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/13/"},"14":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/14/"},"15":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/15/"},"16":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/16/"},"17":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/17/"},"18":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/18/"},"19":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/19/"},"20":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/20/"},"21":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/21/"},"22":{"ml":"crimson-reset|/manga/crimson-reset/22/"},